iZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-04-16T08:26:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:06:46Z","closed_at":"2026-06-23T19:55:12Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118634","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118634.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-23T19:55:12Z"},"body":"Resolves godotengine/godot-proposals#5488.\r\nSupersedes #102009.\r\n\r\nThis adds the ability to drag-toggle the visibility of nodes in the scene node editor, where the toggled state of the first node is applied to any subsequent node whose visibility button you drag across.\r\n\r\nUnlike #102009 this involves no `Tree` changes (which seemed to be a point of contention there) and is instead contained almost entirely within the `gui_input` handler of `SceneTreeEditor`.\r\n\r\n[visibility-dragging.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ccb1a4f-3807-4b48-b7aa-da3cb63eb028)\r\n\r\nA couple of noteworthy quirks:\r\n\r\n1. The undo action is created when you release the mouse button, meaning after we've already changed the visibility states. There may potentially be some edge-cases where we never actually put the changes on the undo stack.\r\n2. Since we don't suppress the `Tree` button handling when starting the drag operation, the visibility button you start from will be in a pressed state for the duration of the drag.\r\n\r\n---\r\n_Disclaimer: AI tooling was used to review this change, which prompted a few minor changes, all of which have been carefully reviewed to the best of my ability._","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"